<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="11">
<name>Control System</name>
<section id="60001_S0006" variety="S0006">
<name>Body Multiplex Communication [LIN]</name>
<ttl id="60001_S0006_741KA_T000J" variety="T000J">
<name>Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN]</name>
<para id="RM000001Z23006X" category="D" type-id="3001B" name-id="9408O-00" from="200612">
<name>How to Proceed with Troubleshooting</name>
<subpara id="RM000001Z23006X_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___000006M00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<descript-diag>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Vehicle brought to workshop</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Symptom Check</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect Large-scale Body Multiplex Communication System [LIN] Communication Function</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), perform a communication function inspection of the large-scale body multiplex communication system and check that there is no malfunction in the communication system.</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.17in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.96in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Code (ECU not connected, communication line malfunction) output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Code (ECU not connected, communication line malfunction) not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to the section for each system</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Check DTC</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check for DTCs and record any codes that are output.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Clear the DTCs.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Based on the recorded codes, reproduce the problem symptom and check whether the same DTC is output again.</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.86in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.27in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No DTC output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 7</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>List by Symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>Check whether the symptom corresponds to an item in the List by Symptom.</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="3.17in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="0.96in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Not listed in List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Corresponds to List by Symptom</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
<results>
<result>B</result>
<action-ci-right>Go to step 7</action-ci-right>
<result-ci-down>A</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Perform troubleshooting using the following methods based on the problem symptom</testtitle>
<test1>
<ptxt>ECU Data Monitor/Active Test (see <xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000YF700FX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Terminals of ECU (see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000068L013X"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
<descript-testgroup>
<testtitle>Inspect, Repair or Replace</testtitle>
<results>
<result-ci-down>NEXT</result-ci-down>
<action-ci-fin>END</action-ci-fin>
</results>
</descript-testgroup>
</descript-diag>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>